=== err-undefined-variable
--- sg
%a = 1
>: %zz
--- err
Sigil error: line 2: undefined variable: %zz

=== err-output-before-the-error-is-kept
--- sg
>: 'before'
>: %zz
--- out
before
--- err
Sigil error: line 2: undefined variable: %zz

=== err-division-by-zero
--- sg
>: 1 / 0
--- err
Sigil error: line 1: division by zero

=== err-unknown-system-call-with-a-hint
--- sg
>: #data
--- err
Sigil error: line 1: unknown system call: #data (did you mean #date?)

=== err-reports-the-innermost-line
--- sg
? true:
    @true:
        %a = 1
        >: %zz
--- err
Sigil error: line 4: undefined variable: %zz

=== err-inside-a-function-reports-the-function-line
--- sg
$f(%n):
    :< 1 / %n
>: $f(0)
--- err
Sigil error: line 2: division by zero

=== err-index-out-of-range
--- sg
%l = [1, 2, 3]
>: %l[3]
--- err
Sigil error: line 2: index 3 out of range (length 3)

=== err-negative-index
--- sg
%l = [1, 2, 3]
>: %l[-1]
--- err
Sigil error: line 2: index -1 out of range (length 3)

=== err-index-must-be-whole
--- sg
%l = [1]
>: %l['a']
--- err
Sigil error: line 2: index must be a whole number

=== err-assign-into-text
--- sg
%s = 'abc'
%s[0] = 'x'
--- err
Sigil error: line 2: only list elements can be assigned (text is read-only)

=== err-num-names-the-text
--- sg
>: #num('abc')
--- err
Sigil error: line 1: #num cannot convert 'abc' to a number

=== err-foreach-over-a-number
--- sg
@%n : 5:
    >: 1
--- err
Sigil error: line 1: can only loop over a list or text

=== err-return-outside-a-function
--- sg
:< 1
--- err
Sigil error: line 1: :< can only be used inside a function

=== err-else-without-if
--- sg
>
    >: 'x'
--- err
Sigil error: line 1: else branch without a matching condition

=== err-bad-indentation
--- sg
? true:
  >: 'x'
--- err
Sigil error: line 2: indentation must use tabs or groups of four spaces

=== err-wrong-argument-count
--- sg
$s(%a, %b):
    :< %a
>: $s(1)
--- err
Sigil error: line 3: $s expects 2 argument(s), got 1

=== err-undefined-function
--- sg
>: $nope()
--- err
Sigil error: line 1: undefined function: $nope

=== err-invalid-operation-is-an-error-not-a-crash
--- sg
>: 'a' - 1
--- err~
Sigil error: line 1: invalid operation

=== err-input-ended
--- sg
%a = <:
--- err
Sigil error: line 1: input ended before a value was entered

=== err-rnd-bad-range
--- sg
>: #rnd(10, 1)
--- err
Sigil error: line 1: #rnd lower bound must not exceed upper bound

=== err-repetition-is-capped
--- sg
>: [0] * 100000000
--- err
Sigil error: line 1: result would exceed 1,000,000 elements

=== err-add-must-be-assigned-back
--- sg
%l = [1]
#add(%l, 2)
--- err
Sigil error: line 2: unknown statement: #add(%l, 2)
